of the recovery curve. Number six will

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:22.920
be sleep and the nervous system. Stress

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:24.240
may also be preventing your skin from

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:26.280
healing. A study published in the

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:29.000
journal Investigating Dermatology found

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:32.080
that acute psychological stress delayed

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:34.480
skin barrier recovery by around 10% in

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:37.120
healthy women with measurable increases

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:39.200
