00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:27.600
your blood flow and keeps your face off

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:29.800
of the pillow that is collecting oil and

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:31.920
friction all night long, rubbing all of

00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:33.600
your skin care products on the pillow,

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:35.000
and rubbing your hair products onto the

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:37.960
pillow as well, and then ended up in

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:39.400
face. Ideally, you're also doing less in

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:41.600
your life during this time because this

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:44.160
is not the week for a huge project

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:46.160
launch or an exam if you can help it.

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:48.920
Take your walks, manage your stress, sit

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:51.880
in silence, and let your body be relaxed

00:20:48.920 --> 00:20:53.960
and bored and calm down. Your skin is

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:56.160
quite literally a reflection of how

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:58.280
regulated your nervous system is right

00:20:56.160 --> 00:21:00.200
now. Also, stop looking at your face in

00:20:58.280 --> 00:21:02.080
