00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:36.960
because it has no resources to repair

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:38.600
with. Limit sugar intake if you can

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:40.560
because one of the clearest changes that

00:21:38.600 --> 00:21:43.000
